/* 与 page gradient-bg 同系：#c4b5fd → #a5b4fc → #93c5fd，只做极轻叠层，避免白块/强紫 */
.chat-input-bar.data-v-5f0df289 {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 50;
  padding: 10rpx 28rpx calc(16rpx + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(196, 181, 253, 0) 0%, rgba(165, 180, 252, 0.22) 45%, rgba(147, 197, 253, 0.32) 100%);
  backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
  border-top: 1rpx solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.32);
}
.toolbar-row.data-v-5f0df289 {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 28rpx;
  padding: 8rpx 0 14rpx;
}
.tb-btn.data-v-5f0df289 {
  width: 56rpx;
  height: 56rpx;
  border-radius: 50%;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.26);
  border: 1rpx solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.38);
  transition: background 0.15s ease, transform 0.12s ease;
}
.tb-btn text.data-v-5f0df289 {
  font-size: 34rpx;
  line-height: 1;
}
.tb-btn.data-v-5f0df289:active {
  transform: scale(0.94);
}
.tb-btn.on.data-v-5f0df289 {
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
  border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55);
}
.composer-row.data-v-5f0df289 {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-end;
  gap: 16rpx;
}
.input-textarea.data-v-5f0df289 {
  flex: 1;
  min-width: 0;
  min-height: 76rpx;
  max-height: 200rpx;
  padding: 16rpx 22rpx;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.34);
  border: 1rpx solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.42);
  border-radius: 20rpx;
  font-size: 30rpx;
  line-height: 1.45;
  color: #374151;
}
.voice-hold.data-v-5f0df289 {
  flex: 1;
  min-height: 76rpx;
  padding: 18rpx 24rpx;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.34);
  border: 1rpx solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.42);
  border-radius: 20rpx;
}
.voice-hold .voice-text.data-v-5f0df289 {
  font-size: 30rpx;
  color: #4b5563;
  font-weight: 500;
  letter-spacing: 2rpx;
}
.voice-hold.recording.data-v-5f0df289 {
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.52);
  border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.58);
}
.voice-hold.recording .voice-text.data-v-5f0df289 {
  color: #5b21b6;
}
.voice-hold.cancelling.data-v-5f0df289 {
  background: rgba(254, 226, 226, 0.55);
  border-color: rgba(252, 165, 165, 0.65);
}
.voice-hold.cancelling .voice-text.data-v-5f0df289 {
  color: #991b1b;
}
.send-btn.data-v-5f0df289 {
  width: 76rpx;
  height: 76rpx;
  min-width: 76rpx;
  border-radius: 50%;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
  border: 1rpx solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
  transition: background 0.15s ease, transform 0.12s ease;
}
.send-btn text.data-v-5f0df289 {
  font-size: 30rpx;
  color: #9ca3af;
  transform: translateX(2rpx);
}
.send-btn.on.data-v-5f0df289 {
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.62);
  border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72);
}
.send-btn.on text.data-v-5f0df289 {
  color: #6d28d9;
}
.send-btn.data-v-5f0df289:active {
  transform: scale(0.94);
}
.send-btn.data-v-5f0df289:not(.on) {
  pointer-events: none;
  opacity: 0.75;
}
.voice-overlay.data-v-5f0df289 {
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.18);
  backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  z-index: 1000;
}
.voice-panel.data-v-5f0df289 {
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.88);
  border-radius: 24rpx;
  padding: 44rpx 52rpx;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 20rpx;
  border: 1rpx solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
  box-shadow: 0 16rpx 48rpx rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.12);
}
.voice-panel.cancelling.data-v-5f0df289 {
  background: rgba(254, 242, 242, 0.95);
  border-color: rgba(252, 165, 165, 0.5);
}
.voice-wave.data-v-5f0df289 {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10rpx;
  height: 88rpx;
}
.wave-bar.data-v-5f0df289 {
  width: 8rpx;
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, #a5b4fc, #93c5fd);
  border-radius: 4rpx;
  animation: wave-5f0df289 0.5s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
}
@keyframes wave-5f0df289 {
from {
    height: 18rpx;
    opacity: 0.55;
}
to {
    height: 56rpx;
    opacity: 1;
}
}
.voice-hint.data-v-5f0df289 {
  font-size: 26rpx;
  color: #6b7280;
}
.voice-time.data-v-5f0df289 {
  font-size: 40rpx;
  color: #4b5563;
  font-weight: 600;
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
}
.image-edit-overlay.data-v-5f0df289 {
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  background: rgba(55, 65, 120, 0.45);
  backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  z-index: 1000;
}
.image-edit-panel.data-v-5f0df289 {
  flex: 1;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}
.edit-header.data-v-5f0df289 {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  padding: 24rpx 32rpx;
  color: #f9fafb;
}
.edit-header text.data-v-5f0df289 {
  font-size: 28rpx;
}
.edit-header .edit-title.data-v-5f0df289 {
  font-weight: 600;
  color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
}
.edit-header .edit-confirm.data-v-5f0df289 {
  color: #e0e7ff;
}
.edit-preview.data-v-5f0df289 {
  flex: 1;
  width: 100%;
}
.edit-tools.data-v-5f0df289 {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-around;
  padding: 24rpx 20rpx calc(24rpx + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
  backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
}
.tool-item.data-v-5f0df289 {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 6rpx;
  padding: 10rpx 20rpx;
}
.tool-item text.data-v-5f0df289 {
  font-size: 34rpx;
  color: #fff;
}
.tool-item .tool-label.data-v-5f0df289 {
  font-size: 22rpx;
  color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82);
}